# Backend

This directory contains a minimal FastAPI backend for Antigravity sessions.

## Start locally

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python main.py
```

The backend listens on port 8080 by default.

## Deploy to Cloud Run

Use the repo root `deploy.sh` helper or mirror the Cloud Run example in `cloudbuild.yaml`.

## Notes

This backend intentionally starts a separate Antigravity CLI process per session and exposes streaming updates through WebSockets.
